  "title": "Chanterelle Mushroom Soup",
  "description": "Chanterelles have a lovely mellow flavor and a beautiful light-orange color. If you can't get your hands on chanterelles, any other wild mushroom or store-bought chestnut mushrooms will do.",
  "authors": [
    "LorraineMargaret"
